ocality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n\n### About [Borivali West, Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nLocated in Mumbai's northwest, Borivali West is a vibrant fastest growing suburb in the city. This locality is extremely popular among families, working professionals, an...\n\nLocated in Mumbai's northwest, Borivali West is a vibrant fastest growing suburb in the city. This locality is extremely popular among families, working professionals, and retirees due to its beautiful natural surroundings, contemporary infrastructure, and good connections. \n\nThe real estate market in Borivali West offers a variety of assets, from budget-friendly apartments to opulent homes, appealing to varied preferences.\n\n### Transportation in Borivali West\n\nThe Western Express Highway and Link Road pass through Borivali, providing easy access to both the southern parts of Mumbai and the suburbs.\n\nBorivali Railway Station connect the area to the Western Line.\n\nMumbai Metro Line 2A connects Borivali West to Dahisar, Kandivali, and other suburbs.\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is just 18 km away form Borivali West.\n\nBEST buses, cabs, and autos are also available in the locality.\n\n### Educational Institutes in & around Borivali West\n\n### Healthcare in & around Borivali West\n\n### Shopping & Recreation in & around Borivali West\n\n### Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green Space\nBorivali West truly feels like home. Daily needs are covered with multiple malls, local markets, restaurants and places like Moksh Plaza. Connectivity via Borivali Railway, Western Express Highway saves hours. Weekend nature walks in SGNP or trips to Gorai Beach are my family’s highlight.\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi National Park on weekends, excellent schools, hospitals, and easy metro and rail connectivity make daily life effortless.\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi National Park on weekends, excellent schools, hospitals, and easy metro and rail connectivity make daily life effortless.\n\nFamily-Friendly Yet Vibrant Locale\nAs a family resident, I love the strong social infrastructure here - Don Bosco, Swami Vivekanand schools, good hospitals, Indraprastha market, and parks.\n\n## Flats Price Trend in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Quarter | Borivali West  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Mathuradas Road  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Chandavarkar Road  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Borivali  (% Change in Q-o-Q) |\n| Apr-June'26 | ₹ 25003/ sq.ft3% | -- | ₹ 25118/ sq.ft3% | ₹ 24530/ sq.ft2% |\n| Jan-Mar'26 | ₹ 24363/ sq.ft2% | -- | ₹ 24316/ sq.ft2% | ₹ 24001/ sq.ft2% |\n| Oct-Dec'25 | ₹ 23914/ sq.ft-1% | -- | ₹ 23764/ sq.ft-2% | ₹ 23455/ sq.ft-1% |\n| Jul-Sept'25 | ₹ 24273/ sq.ft-4% | -- | ₹ 24149/ sq.ft-3% | ₹ 23772/ sq.ft-2% |\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Year | Borivali West  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Chandavarkar Road  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Borivali  (% Change in Y-o-Y) |\n| 2025 | ₹ 24498/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 24455/ sq.ft12% | ₹ 23146/ sq.ft11% |\n| 2024 | ₹ 22004/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 21902/ sq.ft8% | ₹ 20913/ sq.ft9% |\n| 2023 | ₹ 19895/ sq.ft3% | -- | ₹ 19183/ sq.ft4% |\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Year | Borivali West  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Chandavarkar Road  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Borivali  (% Change in Y-o-Y) |\n| 2025 | ₹ 24498/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 24455/ sq.ft12% | ₹ 23146/ sq.ft11% |\n| 2024 | ₹ 22004/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 21902/ sq.ft8% | ₹ 20913/ sq.ft9% |\n| 2023 | ₹ 19895/ sq.ft3% | -- | ₹ 19183/ sq.ft4% |\n| 2022 | ₹ 19244/ sq.ft4% | -- | ₹ 18486/ sq.ft3% |\n| 2021 | ₹ 18518/ sq.ft4% | -- | ₹ 17888/ sq.ft5% |\n\n## Newly 