before the launch advertising. If you’re serious about a project, it pays to know where it is in its cycle. [Read the guide ›](/guides/mumbai-real-estate-timing-and-early-access)\n\n[Ask MPE on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20am%20considering%20One%20Borivali%20in%20Borivali%20West.%20Where%20is%20it%20in%20its%20cycle%2C%20and%20what%20are%20the%20best%20options%20right%20now%3F)\n\n## Project description\n\n### Project details\n\nOne Borivali is a Residential Project Developed by the Osho Developers. It is located at Borivali West. It is well-connected to other parts of the city and beyond. 5 minutes from Borivali Station and Link Road. 10 minutes to Western Express Highway. Borivali West enjoys good connectivity through both road and rail. Close proximity to the social infrastructure. It is a 31 storey standalone tower offering 2 and 3 BHK Luxurious residences. Unobstructed Views of Gorai Creek & City. 3 Podium Parking. Gated Community Living and zero wastage. Double Height Air-conditioned Lobby with exclusive lifestyle amenities which includes Infinity Pool, gym, Mini Theatre, children's play area, ample car parking.\n\n### Project remarks\n\n### Project ratings\n\n4.2\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nBuilding\n\n9.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLocation\n\n8.5\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nAmenities\n\n7.9\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLegal\n\n8.7\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nValue for Money\n\n## Osho Developers\n\n**Developer:** [Osho Developers](/projects-in-osho-developers)\n\n### Other projects by Osho Developers\n\n[Neel Kamal Heights, Borivali West](/project/neel-kamal-heights-borivali-west/20278)[Ashwin Heights, Kandivali West](/project/ashwin-heights-kandivali-west/6985)\n\n[Browse all projects in Borivali West →](/projects-in-borivali-west)\n\n## 📸 Project Gallery (7 images)\n\n![Main Image](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/28656/28656-main.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nMain Image\n\n![Floor Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded